---
<Layout title={"Porting & Optimization | Game Nock"} description={"Porting and performance optimisation for Unity games: profiling, memory, load times, engine upgrades and new platforms."} active="services" contact={true}>
<section class="pg-hero"><div class="wrap"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="/services/">Services</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Porting &amp; Optimization</span></nav><span class="eyebrow">Porting & Optimization</span><h1>Porting and Optimisation for Existing Games.</h1><p class="lede">Frame-rate, memory and load-time improvements, engine upgrades and delivery to new platforms.</p><div class="ctas"><button class="btn btn-primary mag" data-contact>Discuss Your Project <svg><use href="#arrow"/></svg></button><a class="btn btn-wa-solid" href="https://wa.me/923184142473" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg><use href="#whatsapp"/></svg> Chat on WhatsApp</a></div></div></section><section class="sp "><div class="wrap"><div class="g2"><div class="glass"><span class="eyebrow">Problems we solve</span><h2 class="ttl">When Teams Call Us</h2><ul class="facts"><li>Your game drops frames or overheats devices</li><li>Memory crashes or long load times hurt reviews</li><li>You need to move to a newer Unity version</li><li>You want to bring your game to another platform</li></ul></div>
      <div class="glass"><span class="eyebrow">Deliverables</span><h2 class="ttl">What You Receive</h2><ul class="facts"><li>Profiling report with prioritised fixes</li><li>Rendering, memory and CPU optimisation</li><li>Load-time and build-size reduction</li><li>Unity version upgrades</li><li>Platform ports and input adaptation</li><li>Regression testing on target devices</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="sp "><div class="wrap"><div class="g2"><div class="glass"><span class="eyebrow">Project stages</span><h2 class="ttl">Where This Fits</h2><ul class="facts"><li>Live game with performance complaints</li><li>Pre-launch performance pass</li><li>Expanding a released game to new platforms</li></ul></div>
      <div class="glass"><span class="eyebrow">Technologies</span><h2 class="ttl">What We Use</h2><table class="tbl"><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Engine</th><td>Unity</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Platforms</th><td>iOS, Android, PC, WebGL, Quest</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Tools</th><td>Unity Profiler, Memory Profiler, Frame Debugger, platform tools</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></section><section class="sp "><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><span class="eyebrow">Process</span><h2>How We Deliver</h2></div><ol class="ksteps"><li class="glass"><h3>Review</h3><p>We study your project and goals.</p></li><li class="glass"><h3>Plan</h3><p>Scope, team, milestones and risks.</p></li><li class="glass"><h3>Build</h3><p>Iterative development with regular builds.</p></li><li class="glass"><h3>Test</h3><p>QA on target devices.</p></li><li class="glass"><h3>Deliver</h3><p>Release, handover and support.</p></li></ol><p style="margin-top:24px"><a class="link" href="/how-we-work/">See the full process <svg><use href="#arrow"/></svg></a></p></div></section><section class="sp "><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><span class="eyebrow">Related work</span><h2>Projects Where We Did This</h2></div><div class="g3"><a class="glass ccard" href="/work/gamisodes-baby-einstein/" data-tags="mobile backend"><div class="ci"><Picture src={i_01_gamisodes} formats={["avif","webp"]} fallbackFormat="webp" widths={[400, 720, 1080]} sizes="(max-width: 700px) 92vw, (max-width: 1100px) 46vw, 560px" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Gamisodes / Baby Einstein key art" /></div>
  <div class="cb"><div class="tags"><span class="tag2">Interactive entertainment</span><span class="tag2">iOS and Android</span></div><h3 style="font-size:22px;margin:0 0 10px">Gamisodes / Baby Einstein</h3><ul class="facts"><li>50+ mini-games</li><li>Unity, PlayFab, Tenjin and AppsFlyer</li><li>Deep links and ATT implementation</li></ul><span class="more">View case study <svg><use href="#arrow"/></svg></span></div></a></div></div></section><section class="sp "><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span><h2>Common Questions</h2></div><div class="faq"><details class="glass"><summary>Where do you start?</summary><p>With a short profiling phase on your target devices, followed by a written report of what to fix first and why.</p></details><details class="glass"><summary>Do you need our full project?</summary><p>Yes, we need the project and a way to build it. We work under NDA.</p></details></div></div></section>
</Layout>
